  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">・業務提携先との協業関係の強化等のため</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
